  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Civil Society Harvesting Results Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Mozambique, there were 13 active partnerships under three instruments: Power of Voices, Power of women and SRHR Partnership fund. These were funded directly by the Ministry in the Netherlands and the Embassy of the Kingdom of the Netherlands in Maputo (EKN MAP) had the role to monitor and take actions to support these SCS strategic partnerships:
During the program implementation the EKN MAP took up several initiatives under the SCS program: 
(i)	Workshop &#x2018;introduction and knowledge sharing&#x2019; with the strategic partnership coalitions active in Mozambique;
(ii)	Third Party Monitoring;
(iii)	Data Quality Assessment Training;
(iv)	Regional Linking and Learning event;

The program is now at the end of its implementation period, and following the above mentioned exercises, the Netherlands Embassy in Maputo seeks to convene a two-day workshop to harvest results, generate insights, and promote cross-learning among the 13 partnerships working in Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
